Lord Gith is the dead savior of the githyanki people, the warrior who led them
to freedom from their former enslavers, the mind flayers.  He has been dead
for centuries and stands before you now due to the unholy power of the Lich
Queen of the githyanki. In life he was undefeatable, he now commands dark 
powers beyond the realm of mortal men.

